OL,3,GNEWSAParents react after issues at
OL,4,Anursery revealed in report
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents whose children went to a
OL,7,Fnursery that was shut down last month
OL,8,Fdue to a "risk to children's safety"
OL,9,Freacted as a report revealed the extent
OL,10,Fof inspectors' concerns.
OL,12,FJungle Junction in Denton, Greater
OL,13,FManchester, was temporarily closed in
OL,14,FOctober by Ofsted and given a list of
OL,15,Fsteps it needed to take in order to
OL,16,Freopen.
OL,18,FIt included an order that "food is
OL,19,Fprepared in a way that prevents choking
OL,20,Fand children are within sight and
OL,21,Fhearing of staff".
